	(text "3S LiPo or protected camper 12 V via XT60 harness. A regulated 5 V source uses the same XT60 through the protected bypass.\nPanel NKK S333 selects buck / OFF / external 5 V. Common 0 V.\n3 x WS2812 channels on GP4, GP5, GP6. 6 A LED total on external power.\nKeep battery LED budget to 4.5 A pending enclosed thermal testing.\nSee README for wiring, design status and copper calculations."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
